sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant You
  participant RN as Reminder note
  participant Main as Electron main (scheduler)
  participant Cat as Cat head
  participant OS as Windows notification
  You->>RN: New note, Reminder type, set date and time
  RN->>Main: saved (store:saveAll)
  loop every 15 s, after each save, on wake
    Main->>Main: pendingReminders(tasks, ledger, now)
  end
  Main-->>Cat: 5 minutes before: "Psst, coming up in a few minutes"
  Main-->>OS: "Due in 5 min"
  Main-->>Cat: At the deadline: overdue bubble + badge
  Main-->>OS: "Due now"
  You->>Cat: Done, Open or Dismiss
  Note over Main: each stage recorded in the ledger,<br/>so nothing fires twice
